title: CEO_Act1
---
CEO: Hello there, Litte Skier!
CEO: It's wonderful to meet you. 
CEO: I'm the CEO of The Company.
CEO: I hope to see you around more often, and soon...
===

title: CEO_Act2
---
CEO: It's quite sad, how much this state has suffered from resort closures.
CEO: Thankfully, this resort has the advantage of its high attitude.
CEO: But artifical snow and new trails may breathe life into this place just yet.
CEO: We will make this a place visitors can rely on to have a long ski season.
CEO: Enjoy these trails while you still can, Little Skier.
===

title: CEO_Act3
---
CEO: ...
CEO: So you wish to stop this.
CEO: Good luck, Little Skier.
===

title: CEO_Act4
---
CEO: WHATEVER!
CEO: LITERALLY WHATEVER!
CEO: I'M NOT EVEN THE CEO!
CEO: I'M JUST THE ASSISTANT REGIONAL MANAGER!
CEO: I DIDN'T WANT THIS DAMN RESORT ANYWAY!
